sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant Route
    participant Auth_Middleware
    participant Controller
    participant Service

    Client->>+Route: PATCH /:id/read
    Route->>+Auth_Middleware: Validate
    Note over Auth_Middleware: 🔐 Authentication&#58; JWT token verify করা হচ্ছে
    Note over Auth_Middleware: Roles&#58; USER_ROLES.TASKER, USER_ROLES.POSTER
    Auth_Middleware->>-Route: Valid ✓
    Route->>+Controller: NotificationController.readNotification
    Controller->>+Service: NotificationService.markNotificationAsReadIntoDB()
    Service->>-Controller: result
    Controller->>-Route: StatusCodes.OK - Notification Read Successfully
    Route-->>Client: Response
    Note over Client: ✅ Notification Read Successfully
